<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="fbd79e22e-7a12-4a8e-bac0-c1e83fd04bbb">All other expenses for each reportable segment primarily consist of:

         Heavy Fabrications-variable overhead, salaries and benefits, and rent and utilities

         Gearing- salaries and benefits and rent and utilities

         Industrial Solutions-direct labor, salaries and benefits, and rent and utilities

         Corporate-professional expenses</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="f93225a17-708f-48e9-93d4-363f705bac18">

Variable lease costs consist primarily of taxes, insurance, utilities, and common area or other maintenance costs for the Company&#8217;s leased facilities and equipment.</ix:footnote>
<ix:footnote xml:lang="en-us" id="f7a5f148d-7e50-43b6-8310-9801ef9ca770">For the year ended December 31, 2025, taxes were primarily incurred in Texas and North Carolina.</ix:footnote></ix:hidden>
