     <td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt;">The Heavy Fabrications segment listing does not include the tower storage yards of&#160;25 acres in Abilene, TX.</p> </td>
