     <td style="vertical-align:top;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt;">The Gearing leased facilities will reduce to approximately 197,000 square feet effective December 1, 2026 pursuant to the terms of the facility lease.</p> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: left; font-size: 10pt;">&#160;</p> </td>
    </tr>

