  <p style="font-size: 3pt; margin: 0; text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:center;">&#160;</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:center;">The accompanying notes are an integral part of these consolidated financial statements.</p>
  <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;"><b>&#160;</b></p>
  <div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
