   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">Intangible assets represent the fair value assigned to definite-lived assets such as trade names and customer relationships. Estimated useful lives for intangibles assets range from<b> </b><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2025-12-31_RangeAxis-MinimumMember" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife" id="c141759739" format="ixt-sec:duryear">6</ix:nonNumeric> to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2025-12-31_RangeAxis-MaximumMember" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetUsefulLife" id="c141759740" format="ixt-sec:duryear">20</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years. Intangible assets are amortized on a straight-line basis over their estimated useful lives, with a remaining life range from <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2025-12-31_RangeAxis-MinimumMember" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsRemainingAmortizationPeriod1" id="c141759741" format="ixt-sec:duryear">0</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;to <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="i_2025-12-31_RangeAxis-MaximumMember" name="us-gaap:FiniteLivedIntangibleAssetsRemainingAmortizationPeriod1" id="c141759742" format="ixt-sec:duryear">2</ix:nonNumeric>&#160;years. Amortization expense was&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c141759743" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfIntangibleAssets" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">661</ix:nonFraction>&#160;for the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>. As of <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025</em>, estimated future amortization expense is as follows:</p>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
