</tbody></table>
   <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin: 0pt;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">Amortization associated with new right-of-use assets obtained in exchange for new operating lease liabilities is $<ix:nonFraction id="c141759848" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortizationExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">13</ix:nonFraction><b>&#160;</b>and $<ix:nonFraction id="c141759849" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeaseRightOfUseAssetAmortizationExpense" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">4</ix:nonFraction>&#160;for the years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> December 31, 2025 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, respectively. During <em style="font: inherit;">2025,</em> the Company executed a lease amendment that extended the term of the Gearing facility lease and reduced the amount of&#160;square footage leased. These lease provisions&#160;are&#160;effective <em style="font: inherit;"> December 1, 2026.&#160;</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">&#160;</p>
