   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;"><sup style="vertical-align:top;line-height:120%;">(<em style="font: inherit;">1</em>)&#160;</sup>All other expenses for each reportable segment primarily consist of:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<b>Heavy Fabrications</b>-variable overhead,&#160;salaries and benefits, and rent and utilities</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;"><b>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;Gearing</b>- salaries and benefits and rent and utilities</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<b>Industrial Solutions</b>-direct labor, salaries and benefits, and rent and utilities</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<b>Corporate</b>-professional expenses</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;text-indent:36pt;">The Company generates revenues entirely from transactions completed in the U.S. and its long-lived assets are all located in the U.S. All intercompany revenue is eliminated in consolidation. Transactions between reportable segments are treated consistent with the accounting policies&#160;referenced in Note&#160;<em style="font: inherit;">1,</em> &#8220;Description of Business and Summary of Significant Accounting Policies&#8221; of these consolidated financial statements. During <em style="font: inherit;">2025</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c141760038" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-HeavyFabricationsMember" unitRef="Pure" name="bwen:NumberOfMajorCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">one</ix:nonFraction><b>&#160;</b>customer&#160;accounted for more than <em style="font: inherit;">10%</em> of total net revenues.&#160;The&#160;customer, reported within the Heavy Fabrications segment and Industrial Solutions segment,&#160;accounted for revenues of $<ix:nonFraction id="c141760040" contextRef="d_2025-01-01_2025-12-31_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-OneCustomerMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-HeavyFabricationsMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerIncludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">100,559</ix:nonFraction>. During <em style="font: inherit;">2024</em>, <ix:nonFraction id="c141760042" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis-SalesRevenueNetMember_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-HeavyFabricationsMember" unitRef="Pure" name="bwen:NumberOfMajorCustomers" scale="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="INF">one</ix:nonFraction>&#160;customer&#160;accounted for more than <em style="font: inherit;">10%</em> of total net revenues. The&#160;customer,&#160;reported within the Heavy Fabrications and Industrial Solutions segment,&#160;accounted for revenues of&#160;$<ix:nonFraction id="c141760044" contextRef="d_2024-01-01_2024-12-31_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis-CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_MajorCustomersAxis-OneCustomerMember_StatementBusinessSegmentsAxis-HeavyFabricationsMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:RevenueFromContractWithCustomerIncludingAssessedTax" scale="3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" decimals="-3">71,607</ix:nonFraction>.&#160;</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;text-align:left;">&#160;</p>
